<title>CANADA: Canadian tax treaties with Ukraine, S.Africa start.</title>
<headline>Canadian tax treaties with Ukraine, S.Africa start.</headline>
<dateline>OTTAWA 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>A treaty between Canada and the Ukraine to avoid double taxation entered into force on April 29, and one with South Africa entered into force on April 30, Canadian Finance Minister Paul Martin announced on Friday.</p>
<p>((Reuters Ottawa Bureau 613-235-6745))</p>
</text>
